<title>BELGIUM: AvH expects jump in 1997 current profit.</title>
<headline>AvH expects jump in 1997 current profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Ackermans &amp; van Haaren NV said on Tuesday it expected current profit to rise sharply in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;AvH expects for 1997, barring unforeseen circumstances, a strong rise of the current result,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>AvH's 1996 group net profit soared 66 percent to 1.58 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
